{"trace_id": "a5b3999a-57fc-4c48-aa86-4997ba5de796", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-004", "text": "在主页面上添加一个文本组件，显示'欢迎'", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T12:28:28.454Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T12:28:45.057Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:28:28.454Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:28:45.057Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "rename_page", "delete_page", "create_page"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_text", "create_rect", "create_circle", "delete_widget", "create_line"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script", "list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_trends", "allowed_actions": ["add_trend_pen"]}], "visible_count": 4, "selected": "manage_graphics", "action": "create_text", "args": {"action": "create_text", "page_id": "main", "widget_id": "text_welcome", "position": [860, 50], "text": "欢迎", "font_size": "24", "style": {"font-weight": "bold", "color": "#333333", "text-align": "center"}}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "PAGE_NOT_FOUND", "error_msg": "page main not found", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.777700032107532, "intended_entities": ["pages.main.widgets.text_welcome"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.main"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce96f177661087f9ab86d524efd537215f5b6cd00506ab99fc00db443f21ff72", "final_hash": "sha256:ce96f177661087f9ab86d524efd537215f5b6cd00506ab99fc00db443f21ff72", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3384, "output_tokens": 432, "latency_ms": 12164.05580000719, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您在主页面上添加一个显示\"欢迎\"的文本组件。我假设主页面的 ID 为 \"main\"，并将其放置在页面上方居中位置。", "reasoning": "The user wants to add a text widget displaying \"欢迎\" (Welcome) on the main page. I need to use the manage_graphics tool with the create_text action.\n\nHowever, I need to know the page_id of the \"主页面\" (main page). I don't have this information. Let me proceed with a reasonable assumption - the main page might have an ID like \"main\" or \"page_main\". \n\nActually, I should ask the user for the page_id since I don't know what the actual ID of the main page is in their project. But let me try with a common convention first - \"main\" or I could ask the user.\n\nLet me proceed with creating the text widget. I'll use \"main\" as the page_id since it's a common convention for the main page. I also need:\n- widget_id: I'll generate something like \"text_welcome\"\n- position: I'll place it in a reasonable location, like center-ish area [660, 100] or similar\n- text: \"欢迎\"\n- font_size: default 14 is fine, or maybe larger for a welcome message\n\nActually, I should probably ask for the page_id if I'm not sure. But let me try with \"main\" as a reasonable assumption for a main page.\n\nLet me create the text widget with reasonable defaults."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3851, "output_tokens": 155, "latency_ms": 4420.659600000363, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "看起来项目中不存在 ID 为 \"main\" 的页面。我需要了解您的主页面信息才能继续操作。\n\n请问：\n1. **主页面已存在吗？** 如果已存在，能否提供主页面的 **页面ID**？\n2. **还是需要先创建主页面？** 如果需要创建，请告诉我页面的名称和分辨率要求（默认为 1920×1080）。\n\n请提供相关信息，我会继续为您配置。", "reasoning": "The page \"main\" was not found. I need to know the actual page ID. I should ask the user for the correct page ID, or I could suggest creating a main page first.\n\nLet me ask the user for the correct page ID or suggest creating a main page."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7235, "output_tokens": 587, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16603.286800032947}, "judge": null}
