s are only `list_history` and `query_history`. There's no `add_history` or `update_history` action available in the current tools.\n\nSince the current phase (CONFIG_HISTORY) doesn't have the tool capability to add/configure historian settings for a tag, I need to inform the user about this limitation. The available tools don't support adding or modifying historian configurations - they only support listing and querying.\n\nI should explain to the user that the current available tools don't support adding history configurations, and I may need to switch to another phase or the functionality isn't available in this session.\n\nWait, let me re-read the instructions. The tool description says \"Historian config + synthetic historical-window queries\" but the allowed actions are only \"list_history\" and \"query_history\". There's no action to add or update history configurations.\n\nI should inform the user that with the current available tools, I cannot add history configurations for PT101. The tools only support listing existing history configurations and querying historical data.\n\nI should let the user know about this limitation and suggest what might be needed (possibly switching to a different phase or this functionality might not be available in the current toolset)."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2166, "output_tokens": 735, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24253.233499999624}, "judge": null}
