工具（generate_layout）当前不可用，可能需要切换到其他阶段或手动修改。\n\n并在回复中包含建议切换的阶段，比如MANAGE_PAGES或GENERATE_LAYOUT。\n\n但GENERATE_LAYOUT已经是可切换的下一阶段。我可以建议切换到那里。\n\n让我回复。"}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6189, "output_tokens": 62, "latency_ms": 3453.647500020452, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要把主监控页面的背景色改成白色。现在处于GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段，可用工具有generate_layout。先查看当前布局。使用show_current_layout动作。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 43744, "output_tokens": 4486, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 123840.88989999145}, "judge": null}
