 8552.661800000351, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先查看系统中是否存在 TI-201 这个点位，以便为其配置报警。让我先查询一下现有的点位列表。", "reasoning": "The user wants to set HH and LL alarms for a point called \"TI-201\", with HH alarm at 100 and LL alarm at 10, both with high priority.\n\nFirst, I need to understand the current state:\n- Current phase: ANALYZE_INTENT\n- Current workflow: AlarmConfig, step: discover_points\n- Available tools: manage_pages (list_pages), manage_points (list_points)\n\nThe user wants to configure alarms for a specific point \"TI-201\". To do this, I should first check if this point exists in the system. Let me call the list_points tool to see what points are available and verify that TI-201 exists.\n\nI should use manage_points with list_points action to discover the existing points first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2119, "output_tokens": 328, "latency_ms": 5879.218999994919, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "TI-201 是一个模拟量点位，确认存在。现在我来为您创建 HH（高高）和 LL（低低）两个报警：", "reasoning": "Good, TI-201 exists and is an analog point. Now I need to create two alarms:\n1. HH alarm (High-High) at 100 with high priority\n2. LL alarm (Low-Low) at 10 with high priority\n\nSince these are two independent alarm creations, I can call them in the same function_calls block.\n\nI'll use create_analog_alarm for both:\n- HH alarm: high_limit = 100\n- LL alarm: low_limit = 10\n\nFor naming conventions, I'll use:\n- alarm_TT201_HH for the high-high alarm\n- alarm_TT201_LL for the low-low alarm"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3844, "output_tokens": 288, "latency_ms": 8195.269400021061, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "报警配置完成！已成功为 **TI-201** 创建两个报警：\n\n| 报警ID | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|------|--------|------|\n| `alarm_TI201_HH` | High-High (HH) | 100 | High | ✅ 已创建 |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | Low-Low (LL) | 10 | High | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n当 TI-201 的值超过 100 或低于 10 时，将触发相应的高优先级报警。\n\n如果您还需要：\n- 为这两个报警设置死区（deadband）\n- 添加其他点位的报警\n- 进入下一阶段配置\n\n请告诉我，您希望继续什么操作？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The alarms have been created successfully. Let me summarize what was done for the user.\n\nTwo analog alarms were created for TI-201:\n1. alarm_TI201_HH - High-High alarm at 100, priority: high\n2. alarm_TI201_LL - Low-Low alarm at 10, priority: high\n\nBoth were created successfully. The user's request has been fulfilled. I should inform them of the completion and suggest next steps if needed."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6937, "output_tokens": 834, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22655.163799994625}, "judge": null}
