ns": ["create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["apply_flow_layout", "group_widgets", "create_rect", "delete_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_devices", "allowed_actions": ["create_device"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["create_schedule"]}], "visible_count": 7, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "bind_point", "args": {"action": "bind_point", "page_id": "pump_station", "widget_id": "pump_b", "property": "value", "tag": "PumpB"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"binding": "pump_b.value=PumpB"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b.bindings.value": "PumpB"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.94369996804744, "intended_entities": ["pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b.bindings.value"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.pump_station", "pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b", "points.PumpB"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": "sha256:5685d4b868b863aa69306a9dfa3bc9b6d239ea5f2e11edb7670e65c664053f28", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 969, "output_tokens": 404, "latency_ms": 17648.47539999755, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析您的需求并检查当前系统状态。您需要：\n1. 新建一个泵站画面页面\n2. 添加2个泵图元（控件）\n3. 分别绑定到 PumpA 和 PumpB 点位\n\n让我先查询当前的点位和页面信息：", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create a new pump station page\n2. Add 2 pump widgets\n3. Bind them to PumpA and PumpB points\n\nLet me first check the current state. I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT phase with the PointBinding workflow. The available tools are:\n- manage_points: can only list_points\n- manage_pages: can only list_pages\n\nThe user wants to:\n1. Create a new page - this would need a create/update action for pages, but I only have list_pages\n2. Add widgets to a page - this would need widget management, but I only have list_pages\n3. Bind points - this would need point binding capability, which isn't available in the current tools\n\nLet me first check what points and pages exist by using the available tools. This will help me understand the current state before advising the user.\n\nActually, looking at the current stage (ANALYZE_INTENT) and available actions (only list), I should:\n1. First query existing points to see if PumpA and PumpB exist\n2. Query existing pages to see current state\n\nThen I need to determine if the current tools can accomplish the task. The available actions are only \"list\" operations, so I cannot create pages or add widgets directly. I may need to suggest switching to a different stage (like MANAGE_PAGES for page creation).\n\nLet me first call both list tools to gather information."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4424, "output_tokens": 355, "latency_ms": 10112.849100027233, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "很好！查询结果如下：\n\n**点位状态：**\n- ✅ **PumpA** - 数字型点位（已存在）\n- ✅ **PumpB** - 数字型点位（已存在）\n\n**页面状态：**\n- 📭 当前无任何页面，需要新建\n\n---\n\n**接下来需要执行的操作：**\n1. 新建\"泵站画面\"页面\n2. 在页面上创建2个泵图元控件\n3. 将 PumpA 和 PumpB 分别绑定到对应泵控件\n\n点位已就绪，现在需要进入页面管理阶段来创建画面和绑定点位。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "Good, I can see:\n1. PumpA and PumpB points already exist as digital points\n2. No pages exist yet\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Create a pump station page\n2. Add 2 pump widgets to the page\n3. Bind PumpA to widget 1 and PumpB to widget 2\n\nBut wait - the current stage is ANALYZE_INTENT and the available tools only have \"list\" actions. I need to switch to a stage that allows me to create pages, widgets, and bind points.\n\nLooking at the available next stages: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nThe most relevant stages are:\n- MANAGE_PAGES - for creating pages and widgets\n- BIND_POINTS - for binding points\n\nI should switch to MANAGE_PAGES first to create the page and add widgets. Let me include \"next_state: MANAGE_PAGES\" in my response."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4792, "output_tokens": 211, "latency_ms": 6331.641200056765, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "现在开始创建泵站画面。首先创建页面：", "reasoning": "Now I'm in the MANAGE_PAGES stage. The available tools are:\n- manage_pages: create_widget, create_page, bind_point\n\nI need to:\n1. Create a pump station page\n2. Create 2 pump widgets\n3. Bind PumpA to widget 1 and PumpB to widget 2\n\nLet me start by creating the page first, then I can create the widgets and bind the points.\n\nFor the page, I'll create it with a reasonable resolution and name it \"泵站画面\" (Pump Station Page).\n\nI'll use a page_id like \"pump_station_page\"."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5061, "output_tokens": 245, "latency_ms": 8182.860300003085, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面创建成功！现在添加2个泵图元控件：", "reasoning": "Good, the page has been created successfully. Now I need to:\n1. Create 2 pump widgets on the page\n2. Bind PumpA to one pump widget and PumpB to the other\n\nLet me create the two pump widgets. I'll place them side by side on the page."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5392, "output_tokens": 194, "latency_ms": 3105.8581999968737, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "两个泵图元已创建成功！现在绑定点位：", "reasoning": "Both pump widgets have been created successfully. Now I need to bind the points:\n- PumpA to pump_a widget (typically the \"value\" or \"status\" property)\n- PumpB to pump_b widget\n\nLet me bind the points to the widgets."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5672, "output_tokens": 301, "latency_ms": 8277.142599981744, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "所有配置已完成！以下是本次操作的汇总：\n\n---\n\n**✅ 泵站画面配置完成**\n\n| 操作 | 详情 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 创建页面 | `泵站画面` (pump_station)，分辨率 1920×1080 | ✅ 完成 |\n| 添加泵图元1 | `pump_a`，位置 (400, 400)，尺寸 200×200 | ✅ 完成 |\n| 添加泵图元2 | `pump_b`，位置 (800, 400)，尺寸 200×200 | ✅ 完成 |\n| 绑定点位1 | `pump_a.value` ← **PumpA** | ✅ 完成 |\n| 绑定点位2 | `pump_b.value` ← **PumpB** | ✅ 完成 |\n\n---\n\n如需进一步配置（如添加报警、历史记录、脚本逻辑等），请告知！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All tasks have been completed successfully:\n1. Created the pump station page (泵站画面)\n2. Added 2 pump widgets (pump_a and pump_b)\n3. Bound PumpA point to pump_a widget\n4. Bound PumpB point to pump_b widget\n\nThe task is complete. I should inform the user and transition to DONE state."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26310, "output_tokens": 1710, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 53732.83910000464}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "1c98f555-1211-406f-a259-b72ad14d6f11", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-016", "text": "在chemical screen加个tank，绑到TI-201上，另外加个button用于start", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T12:51:58.388Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T12:52:28.067Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:51:58.388Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:52:04.337Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:52:04.337Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:52:28.067Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "chem_screen", "name": "chemical screen"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.5714999753981829, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1298, "output_tokens": 116, "latency_ms": 5942.744999949355, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你完成这个配置。首先查看现有页面，找到 chemical screen 的页面 ID。", "reasoning": "The user wants me to:\n1. Add a tank widget to the \"chemical screen\" page, bound to point TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nFirst, I need to list the existing pages to find the \"chemical screen\" page ID. Then I can create the widgets.\n\nLet me start by listing pages."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2075, "output_tokens": 778, "latency_ms": 23723.324400023557, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我找到了 **chemical screen** 页面（ID: `chem_screen`）。\n\n不过，我需要向你说明当前情况：\n\n在 **GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段**，我可用的图形工具仅限于：\n- **create_text** — 创建静态文本标签\n- **create_line** — 绘制线条（如管道）\n- **group_widgets** — 分组控件\n- **set_widget_style** — 设置样式\n- **apply_flow_layout** — 流式布局\n\n**目前无法直接创建 Tank（储罐）和 Button（按钮）这类专业控件**，这些通常属于 HMI 控件库中的高级组件。\n\n我可以做以下替代方案：\n\n1. **用文本标签 + 线条** 创建一个简易的 Tank 示意图作为占位符\n2. 后续切换到 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段完成 TI-201 的点位绑定\n3. 或者切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段查看是否有更多控件管理能力\n\n你希望我：\n- **A)** 先用基础图形（文本+线条）绘制一个 Tank 示意图，并创建一个 \"Start\" 文本按钮？\n- **B)** 直接切换到其他阶段寻找创建专业控件的方法？\n\n请告诉我你的选择。", "reasoning": "The page \"chemical screen\" exists with ID \"chem_screen\". Now I need to:\n1. Create a tank widget - but looking at the available tools in the current stage (GENERATE_LAYOUT), I only have: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout. There's no \"create_tank\" or \"create_button\" action available.\n\nThe tools available are:\n- manage_graphics: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n\nSo I can't directly create a \"tank\" widget or a \"button\" widget with the current tools. The available primitives are only text labels and lines.\n\nHowever, the user's request involves:\n1. Adding a tank (which would typically be a specialized widget)\n2. Binding it to TI-201 (point binding)\n3. Adding a start button\n\nThese seem like widget creation and point binding tasks that aren't available in the current GENERATE_LAYOUT phase. The current phase's tools are more about layout and basic primitives.\n\nI should let the user know that the current stage's available tools don't support creating tank or button widgets directly. The \"BIND_POINTS\" stage might be needed for point binding, but widget creation (tank, button) doesn't seem to be available in the listed tools at all.\n\nLet me inform the user about the limitation and suggest switching to appropriate stages if needed. However, the next available stages are: BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE. None of these seem to have \"create widget\" capabilities either based on the tool descriptions.\n\nActually, I need to work with what I have. I can:\n1. Create text labels as placeholders\n2. Create lines (could represent pipes near a tank)\n\nBut realistically, creating an actual tank widget and a button widget requires tools that aren't available in the current stage. I should explain this to the user.\n\nWait, let me reconsider. The manage_graphics tool's description mentions \"Graphical primitives, layouts, grouping, styling\" but only lists specific actions. Maybe I should try to use what's available and explain the limitations.\n\n\nThe available actions are restricted to create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, and apply_flow_layout. Since tank and button widgets fall outside these capabilities, I should inform the user that these specialized widgets require a different phase or additional tools not currently available in GENERATE_LAYOUT."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ChemicalProductionScreen"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3373, "output_tokens": 894, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 29679.056600027252}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "d9b55aa8-7655-4ec3-b431-1d280d631645", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-018", "text": "新建全局脚本，OnEvent触发，写一段逻辑如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T12:51:59.383Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T12:53:25.496Z", "total_turns": 10, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:51:59.384Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:52:21.856Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:52:21.856Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:53:25.496Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "valve1", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 2.0997999818064272, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "err