: 1.2686000554822385, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 10, "state": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script", "update_script_body", "list_scripts", "delete_script", "disable_script", "enable_script"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_line", "apply_flow_layout", "create_rect"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_notifications", "allowed_actions": ["create_notification_rule"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "create_script", "args": {"action": "create_script", "id": "high_pressure_valve", "name": "PI-201 High Pressure Valve Control", "trigger": "on_event", "period_s": null, "bound_tag": null, "body": "// When event is triggered, check if PI-201 pressure is too high\n// If high, set valve1 to true (open)\nconst threshold = 80; // Pressure threshold in engineering units\nconst pressure = getTagValue(\"PI-201\");\nif (pressure > threshold) {\n    setTagValue(\"valve1\", true);\n    log(\"PI-201 pressure high (\" + pressure + \"), valve1 opened.\");\n} else {\n    // Optionally close valve if pressure is back to normal\n    // setTagValue(\"valve1\", false);\n}"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "ALREADY_EXISTS", "error_msg": "script high_pressure_valve already exists", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.7778999754227698, "intended_entities": ["scripts.high_pressure_valve"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1024, "output_tokens": 304, "latency_ms": 12725.5646000267, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个全局脚本，触发类型是 OnEvent。脚本逻辑是：如果 PI-201 过高，则把 valve1 置位。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具是 manage_scripts 和 manage_points，但都只有 list 功能，没有创建或修改功能。用户明确要求“新建”脚本，但当前可用的 manage_scripts 工具只允许 list_scripts 操作。这不够用。我需要切换到能够创建脚本的阶段。根据提供的可切换下一阶段列表，有 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段。所以，我应该建议切换到 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段，以便能够创建脚本。另外，我还需要确认点位 PI-201 和 valve1 是否存在。我可以使用 manage_points 来列出现有点位进行核实。但当前阶段可用工具中的 manage_points 也只有 list_points 功能。我可以先查询一下点位信息，然后再切换阶段。这样既能确认点位是否存在，又能为后续脚本创建提供依据。那么，我先调用 manage_points 来列出现有点位，同时调用 manage_scripts 来查看现有脚本情况。这两个调用没有依赖关系，可以同时进行。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3657, "output_tokens": 319, "latency_ms": 9726.958799990825, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "很好！我已确认点位 **PI-201**（模拟量）和 **valve1**（数字量）均已存在，目前没有已定义的脚本。\n\n您需要创建一个 **OnEvent** 类型的全局脚本，逻辑如下：\n- 触发条件：事件触发（OnEvent）\n- 脚本内容：判断 PI-201 的值是否过高（例如超过某个阈值），如果过高则将 valve1 置位（设为 true）\n\n**当前阶段**（ANALYZE_INTENT）的工具仅支持查询，无法创建脚本。我需要切换到 **CONFIG_SCRIPT** 阶段才能为您创建该脚本。\n\n**接下来我将切换到 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段。**\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_SCRIPT", "reasoning": "点位 PI-201 和 valve1 都已存在，类型也匹配：PI-201 是模拟量（analog），valve1 是数字量（digital）。用户想要创建一个 OnEvent 脚本，当 PI-201 过高时，将 valve1 置位（即设为 true）。这需要脚本逻辑。当前阶段可用工具不足以创建脚本。因此，我需要切换到 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段。在回复中，我应说明当前信息，并建议切换到 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段以创建脚本。接下来，我会在回复中包含 \"next_state: CONFIG_SCRIPT\" 来触发阶段切换。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3971, "output_tokens": 515, "latency_ms": 14906.858999980614, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在处于 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段，可用工具有 manage_scripts、manage_graphics、manage_points、manage_alarms、manage_notifications。用户要求新建全局脚本，OnEvent 触发，逻辑是如果 PI-201 过高则把 valve1 置位。\n\n我需要使用 manage_scripts 工具，action 为 create_script。需要提供 id、name、trigger、body。trigger 应为 \"on_event\"。body 是脚本内容。\n\n关于“过高”的判断：需要定义阈值。用户没有指定阈值，我可以假设一个合理的阈值，比如 80。或者询问用户。但用户说“写一段逻辑”，可能希望我直接写。我可以写一个示例，使用一个变量 highThreshold，或者直接写 if (getValue(\"PI-201\") > 80) { setValue(\"valve1\", true); }。但最好用通用的写法。\n\n另外，脚本语言可能是 JavaScript 或类似。我需要写一个函数体。通常 SCADA 脚本可能有特定 API，比如 getTagValue、setTagValue。我可以用常见的 API：readPoint、writePoint。但为了通用，我可以写一个简单的逻辑。\n\nid 和 name 需要定义。id 可以是 \"high_pressure_valve\" 或类似，name 可以是 \"PI-201 High Pressure Valve Control\"。\n\n现在调用 manage_scripts create_script。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4558, "output_tokens": 264, "latency_ms": 4306.487500027288, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "错误显示period_s参数需要是数字或null，但我在bound_tag参数中传入了字符串\"None\"。我需要修正参数。bound_tag应该是null（因为OnEvent触发不需要绑定标签），period_s也应该是null。让我重新调用。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4894, "output_tokens": 229, "latency_ms": 5669.643800007179, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The error is about the period_s parameter. I passed \"None\" as a string, but it expects either a number or null. Let me fix this by using null instead of \"None\"."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5195, "output_tokens": 337, "latency_ms": 9841.872700024396, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要创建一个OnEvent触发的脚本。问题是\"period_s\"参数导致了错误。让我仔细查看工具的定义。\n\n在manage_scripts中，create_script的schema显示：\n- period_s: anyOf: [number exclusiveMinimum: 0, null], default: null\n\n看起来我需要显式地设置period_s为null（不是字符串\"None\"）。让我再试一次，这次不传递bound_tag和period_s参数（因为它们有默认值null）。\n\n实际上，看起来JSON解析器在解析period_s时遇到了问题。我需要确保不传递period_s参数，或者传递null值。\n\n让我尝试只传递必需的参数：action, id, name, trigger, body。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5604, "output_tokens": 288, "latency_ms": 8149.539400008507, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要创建一个OnEvent触发的脚本，检查PI-201是否过高然后设置valve1。让我再次尝试，这次可能period_s参数有问题。从错误信息看，它期望period_s是数字而不是字符串。让我查看参数定义：period_s是可选的，可以是数字或null。如果我不提供period_s，它可能默认为null。让我尝试不提供period_s参数。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5964, "output_tokens": 269, "latency_ms": 4218.127500033006, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool keeps giving a schema error about period_s. Looking at the schema, period_s should be either a number (positive) or null. The issue might be that when I don't include period_s, it's being sent as a string \"None\" or something similar by the system.\n\nLet me try including period_s explicitly as null."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6305, "output_tokens": 268, "latency_ms": 7405.790899996646, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The issue is that I'm passing \"None\" as a string, but the schema expects either a number or null (not the string \"None\"). I need to pass the actual null value. In JSON, null is represented without quotes. Let me try again with the correct null value."}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6645, "output_tokens": 290, "latency_ms": 7457.539900031406, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool keeps rejecting my request because of the \"period_s\" parameter. Looking at the schema, the issue is that when I use \"None\" for period_s, it's being interpreted as a string \"None\" instead of a null value. Let me try with an actual null value in JSON format.\n\nIn JSON, null should be represented as just `null` without quotes. Let me try again."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 47817, "output_tokens": 3083, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 86112.6880000229}, "judge": null}
