38956, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.009200011845678091, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_trends", "allowed_actions": ["enable_trend_scroll", "create_trend_group", "delete_trend_group", "list_trend_groups"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["set_retention", "disable_history", "query_history"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["create_schedule"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_page"]}, {"name": "manage_databases", "allowed_actions": ["create_database_table"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point"]}], "visible_count": 7, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "create_page", "args": {"action": "create_page", "id": "trend_page_1", "name": "Trend Page", "resolution": [1920, 1080], "background": "#FFFFFF"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"page_id": "trend_page_1"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.trend_page_1": {"id": "trend_page_1", "name": "Trend Page", "resolution": [1920, 1080], "background": "#FFFFFF", "widgets": {}}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.1273999698460102, "intended_entities": ["pages.trend_page_1"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:6fde30c45fe9220cbe432a0058e4e73ae945cde111e9881b9c392ec1cc60574d", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 960, "output_tokens": 351, "latency_ms": 9237.152400019113, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个trend page，并添加一个trend chart来绑定历史数据。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具有manage_pages和manage_points。用户的需求涉及到页面创建和widget绑定，但manage_pages当前只允许list_pages操作，无法创建页面或添加widget。同样，manage_points只允许list_points操作。因此，当前的工具不足以完成用户的请求。\n\n根据行为准则第5条，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。用户的需求涉及到页面和widget管理，应该切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段。不过，还需要考虑历史数据绑定，这可能涉及到点位配置，但当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，首先需要明确意图。\n\n用户说\"建一个trend page，加个trend chart绑定历史数据\"，这明确是一个创建页面和绑定widget的请求。但当前工具集有限，我需要先列出当前可用的页面和点位，以便了解现有资源，然后再决定下一步操作。这符合行为准则第4条：若信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。\n\n因此，我应该先调用manage_pages的list_pages来查看现有页面，同时调用manage_points的list_points来查看可用点位。这样我可以了解当前项目状态，然后向用户确认具体需求。让我同时调用这两个工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3778, "output_tokens": 346, "latency_ms": 10886.08819997171, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我来帮你创建一个趋势页面并绑定历史数据。首先，我需要了解一些信息：\n\n1. **页面设置**：你想要什么分辨率的页面？背景颜色有偏好吗？\n2. **趋势配置**：需要监控哪些数据点？目前系统中还没有创建任何点位（tags），我们需要先定义要监控的SCADA点。\n3. **历史数据**：你想要查看多长时间的历史数据？（比如1小时、24小时等）\n\n根据当前状态，系统中还没有页面和点位。要完成你的需求，我需要：\n1. 先创建需要监控的SCADA点（例如温度、压力等）\n2. 创建趋势页面\n3. 在页面中添加趋势图表并绑定这些点\n\n请告诉我：\n- 需要监控哪些数据点？（例如：温度、压力、流量等）\n- 这些数据点的单位、范围（最小值、最大值）是什么？\n- 你希望查看多长时间的历史数据？\n\n确认这些信息后，我将为你配置完整的趋势监控页面。next_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "目前没有页面也没有点位。用户想要创建trend page并添加trend chart。这需要切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段来创建页面，但当前阶段ANALYZE_INTENT的可用工具不包括创建页面。根据行为准则，我需要在回复中包含\"next_state: MANAGE_PAGES\"来切换到合适的阶段。同时，我也需要了解用户想要绑定哪些历史数据，可能需要先创建点位。\n\n让我先向用户说明情况，并询问他们是否需要先创建点位，然后切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4137, "output_tokens": 275, "latency_ms": 8293.072400032543, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在我处于MANAGE_PAGES阶段，可用工具只有manage_pages，且当前允许的操作是create_page。用户想要创建一个trend page，但还需要绑定历史数据。要绑定历史数据，我需要知道要绑定哪些点位，但目前系统中还没有点位。\n\n不过，我可以先创建页面。用户说\"建一个trend page\"，所以我需要创建一个HMI页面。我需要提供id、name、resolution和background参数。用户没有指定这些，我可以使用合理的默认值。\n\nid需要唯一，可以设为\"trend_page_1\"，name设为\"Trend Page\"，resolution默认1920x1080，background默认白色。\n\n创建页面后，下一步应该是BIND_POINTS阶段来绑定点位，但点位还不存在。也许我应该先创建页面，然后询问用户关于点位的信息。\n\n按照工作流，当前阶段是MANAGE_PAGES，我需要完成这个阶段的任务。让我创建一个页面。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4472, "output_tokens": 492, "latency_ms": 14320.901600003708, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已经成功创建了趋势页面 \"Trend Page\"（页面ID: trend_page_1），分辨率为1920x1080，白色背景。\n\n接下来需要创建SCADA点位并绑定到趋势图表。目前系统中还没有任何点位，我需要先定义要监控的数据点，然后才能创建趋势图表并绑定历史数据。\n\n请告诉我：\n1. 需要监控哪些数据点？（例如：温度、压力、流量等）\n2. 这些点的类型（模拟量/数字量/字符串）、单位、范围（最小值、最大值）是什么？\n\n有了这些信息后，我将创建点位并配置趋势图表。\n\nnext_state: BIND_POINTS", "reasoning": "页面已经创建成功。现在我需要创建趋势图表并绑定历史数据。但是当前阶段是MANAGE_PAGES，而创建趋势图表需要使用manage_trends工具，但该工具不在当前阶段的可用工具列表中。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到可切换的下一阶段中的合适阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, VALIDATE。\n\n我需要先绑定点位，但首先需要创建点位。创建点位需要使用manage_points工具，该工具在BIND_POINTS阶段可能可用。不过，创建趋势图表还需要使用manage_trends工具，这可能在GENERATE_LAYOUT阶段可用。\n\n用户想要\"加个trend chart绑定历史数据\"，这涉及到：\n1. 创建趋势图表\n2. 绑定历史数据\n\n让我先查看可切换的下一阶段：BIND_POINTS可能用于绑定点位，CONFIG_HISTORY用于配置历史记录，GENERATE_LAYOUT可能用于生成布局和添加widget。\n\n由于当前阶段MANAGE_PAGES的可用工具只有manage_pages，而我需要创建趋势图表，我应该切换到一个能够管理趋势图表的阶段。GENERATE_LAYOUT听起来可能包含趋势图表的管理。\n\n让我先检查一下当前项目状态：页面已创建，但没有点位。要绑定历史数据，首先需要有点位。我应该先切换到BIND_POINTS阶段来创建点位。\n\n因此，我将在回复中包含\"next_state: BIND_POINTS\"。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4981, "output_tokens": 420, "latency_ms": 12839.666199986823, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已进入 BIND_POINTS 阶段。现在需要为你创建SCADA点位（tags），这些点位将用于趋势图表并绑定历史数据。\n\n请告诉我需要创建哪些点位？请为每个点位提供以下信息：\n\n1. **标签名称**（例如：Temperature_1, Pressure_Tank1）\n2. **类型**：模拟量（analog）、数字量（digital）还是字符串（string）？\n3. **单位**（例如：℃、bar、%）\n4. **最小值**和**最大值**（仅模拟量需要）\n5. **描述**（可选）\n\n例如：\n- \"反应釜温度\"，模拟量，单位℃，范围0-200\n- \"泵状态\"，数字量（开/关）\n- \"物料名称\"，字符串\n\n请列出所有需要监控的点位，我将为你创建它们。", "reasoning": "用户让我进入 BIND_POINTS 阶段，现在需要使用当前可用工具来创建 SCADA 点位。当前可用工具是 manage_points，动作是 create_point。我需要先询问用户需要创建哪些点位，包括标签名、类型、单位、范围等信息。但用户之前提到要绑定历史数据，我需要先创建点位才能绑定趋势图表。我应该先向用户询问点位的详细信息，然后创建点位。不过，我也需要提醒用户，在创建点位后，还需要创建趋势图表并绑定这些点位。但当前阶段只有 BIND_POINTS，所以我应该专注于创建点位。让我先询问用户需要哪些点位。同时，我需要遵循行为准则：如果信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。现在没有点位信息，我需要向用户确认。我将询问用户需要创建哪些点位，包括标签名、类型、单位、最小值和最大值等信息。然后根据回答创建点位。之后，如果需要创建趋势图表，可能需要切换到其他阶段。现在开始询问。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 18328, "output_tokens": 1884, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 55621.94670003373}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "da486385-9f6f-41cc-bf30-50e01250cb02", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-024", "text": "建一个trend page，加个trend chart绑定历史数据", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T12:58:58.518Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:42.018Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "ASK_USER", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:58:58.518Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:23.848Z"}, {"name": "ASK_USER", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:23.848Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:42.018Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.2527999933809042, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3496999745257199, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.005499983672052622, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 960, "output_tokens": 340, "latency_ms": 9872.38019995857, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！要完成这个任务，我需要先了解当前项目中的页面和点位信息。让我先查询一下：", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create a new page called \"trend page\"\n2. Add a trend chart widget to it\n3. Bind historical data points to the trend chart\n\nCurrently I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage with workflow=PointBinding, step=list_targets. The available tools are:\n- manage_pages (only list_pages action)\n- manage_points (only list_points action)\n\nTo accomplish the user's request, I need to:\n1. First, list existing pages and points to understand what's available\n2. Then create a page with a trend chart widget - but I don't have actions for creating pages or adding widgets\n3. Bind points to the trend chart - this requires bind_point action which is not currently available\n\nThe current stage's available tools don't support:\n- Creating pages (only list_pages is available)\n- Adding widgets\n- Binding points to widgets\n\nI should first gather information by listing pages and points, then suggest moving to another stage that has the necessary capabilities. Let me call the available tools to gather information first.\n\nLooking at the workflow context: workflow=PointBinding, step=list_targets - this suggests I should be listing targets (pages and points) for binding.\n\nLet me list both pages and points to understand what's available, then guide the user on next steps."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3767, "output_tokens": 578, "latency_ms": 15440.22170000244, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我查看了当前项目状态，发现：\n- **页面数量：0** - 还没有创建任何页面\n- **点位数量：0** - 还没有任何 SCADA 点位\n\n要完成「创建 trend page + trend chart + 绑定历史数据」这个任务，我们需要：\n\n| 步骤 | 说明 | 需要的能力 |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| 1️⃣ | 创建 SCADA 点位（至少需要有数据源） | `CONFIG_POINT` 阶段 |\n| 2️⃣ | 创建 HMI 页面（Trend Page） | `GENERATE_LAYOUT` 或 `MANAGE_PAGES` 阶段 |\n| 3️⃣ | 添加 Trend Chart 控件并绑定点位 | `BIND_POINTS` 阶段 |\n| 4️⃣ | 配置历史数据存储 | `CONFIG_HISTORY` 阶段 |\n\n当前阶段（ANALYZE_INTENT）只有查询能力，**无法执行创建操作**。\n\n---\n\n**请问你想怎么推进？**\n\n1. **如果你已有明确的点位规划**（比如 \"我有温度、压力、流量三个模拟量需要监控\"），请告诉我具体有哪些点位需要创建，我来帮你配置。\n\n2. **如果你想我先用默认配置搭建一个演示项目**，我可以帮你：\n   - 创建几个示例点位（如温度、压力等）\n   - 创建 Trend Page 页面\n   - 绑定趋势图\n\n请告诉我你的需求，或者提供需要监控的点位信息！\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "The project is empty - no pages and no points exist yet. To create a trend page with trend chart bound to historical data, I need to:\n\n1. Create a page - but I only have list_pages, not create_page\n2. Create SCADA points (tags) - I only have list_points, not create_point\n3. Add a trend chart widget to the page\n4. Bind historical data points to the trend chart\n\nThe current ANALYZE_INTENT stage with only list operations is insufficient for what the user wants to do. I should suggest moving to a stage that supports:\n- Creating pages\n- Creating/configuring trend widgets\n- Creating points if needed\n\nLooking at the available stages: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nGENERATE_LAYOUT or MANAGE_PAGES might be the right stages to move to for creating pages and widgets.\nCONFIG_HISTORY might be needed for historical data configuration.\nCONFIG_POINT might be needed to create points if none exist.\n\nLet me inform the user about the current state and suggest next steps."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4342, "output_tokens": 577, "latency_ms": 18161.525299947243, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的！现在我需要了解你的具体需求，才能帮你创建合适的趋势页面。\n\n---\n\n**请告诉我以下信息：**\n\n### 1️⃣ 你需要监控哪些点位？\n\n请提供你想要在趋势图上显示的 **SCADA 点位**，例如：\n\n| 点位名称 | 类型 | 工程单位 | 量程范围 |\n|----------|------|----------|----------|\n| 温度 | 模拟量 (analog) | °C | 0 ~ 200 |\n| 压力 | 模拟量 (analog) | kPa | 0 ~ 1000 |\n| 流量 | 模拟量 (analog) | L/min | 0 ~ 500 |\n| ... | ... | ... | ... |\n\n> 如果你还没有规划好，也可以告诉我**场景**（比如 \"锅炉监控\"、\"水处理系统\"），我可以帮你设计点位方案。\n\n---\n\n### 2️⃣ 趋势页面的基本要求？\n\n- **页面名称**：比如 \"实时趋势\" 或 \"生产监控趋势\"\n- **分辨率**：默认 1920×1080，还是其他？\n- **背景颜色**：白色、深色、或其他偏好？\n\n---\n\n**举个例子，你可以这样回复我：**\n> \"我要监控水处理系统的三个参数：进水温度(0~50°C)、出水压力(0~0.6MPa)、进水流量(0~100 m³/h)，页面叫 '水处理趋势监控'\"\n\n告诉我你的需求，我来帮你一步步配置！\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "The user is telling me I'm in the ASK_USER stage, but I'm actually in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage according to the context. Looking at the current situation:\n\n1. The project is empty - no pages, no points\n2. The user wants to create a trend page with trend chart bound to historical data\n3. I need more information from the user about what points they want to monitor\n\nThe current stage (ANALYZE_INTENT) only has list operations available. I cannot create anything in this stage. I should ask the user for the specific point information they need, and then suggest moving to appropriate stages.\n\nSince I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT and need to gather more information to proceed, I should ask the user clarifying questions about what they want to monitor. Let me ask about:\n1. What SCADA points do they need? (names, types, engineering units)\n2. What is the purpose of the trend page?\n\nThis will help me understand their intent better before suggesting we move to other stages that have creation capabilities."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9069, "output_tokens": 1495, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 43500.07289997302}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "ac8f6fd2-27d2-441d-af84-5398593c3fd6", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-025", "text": "建一个反应釜综合监控方案：新建画面，建三个点位（温度、压力、液位），绑到画面的罐子和仪表上，最后下发验证", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:29.502Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T13:00:45.459Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "ASK_USER", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:29.502Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:56.720Z"}, {"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T12:59:56.720Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:00:13.619Z"}, {"name": "ASK_USER", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T13:00:13.619Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:00:45.459Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.2792000197805464, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.85350003791973, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1635, "output_tokens": 686, "latency_ms": 20834.214599977713, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我理解您想要创建一个反应釜综合监控方案，这包括：\n1. 新建HMI画面\n2. 创建三个点位（温度、压力、液位）\n3. 将点位绑定到画面控件\n4. 验证并部署\n\n**但是**，当前处于 **VALIDATE（验证）阶段**，该阶段仅支持只读操作：\n- `manage_pages`: 只能 `list_pages`（查看页面列表）\n- `manage_points`: 只能 `list_points`（查看点位列表）\n- `deployment`: 可以 `validate_project` 和 `show_deployment_status`\n\n**无法执行**创建页面、创建点位、绑定控件等写操作。\n\n让我先帮您了解当前项目的状态，确认现有资源：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a comprehensive reactor monitoring solution:\n1. Create a new page (画面)\n2. Create three points (temperature, pressure, level)\n3. Bind them to widgets on the page\n4. Deploy and validate\n\nHowever, I need to look at the current available tools and actions:\n\nCurrent stage: VALIDATE\nAvailable tools and their allowed actions:\n- manage_pages: list_pages only\n- manage_history: list_history only\n- deployment: show_deployment_status, validate_project\n- manage_scripts: list_scripts only\n- manage_points: list_points only\n\nThe current stage is VALIDATE, which means I can only do validation-related operations. I cannot:\n- Create new pages (only list_pages is allowed)\n- Create new points (only list_points is allowed)\n- Bind points to widgets\n- Deploy\n\nI need to inform the user that the current stage doesn't support these creation operations. I should switch to the appropriate stage that allows these operations. \n\nLooking at the available next stages: ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n\nThe ANALYZE_INTENT stage might be more appropriate for understanding and planning the work. But it seems like I need to be in a stage that allows CRUD operations on pages and points.\n\nWait, let me re-read the instructions. It says:\n\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nThe available next states are: ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n\nFor creating pages, points, and binding them, I would need to be in a different stage. Let me suggest switching to ANALYZE_INTENT first to plan the work, and then we might need to be in a configuration/creation stage.\n\nActually, looking at the workflow context: workflow=DeploymentCheck, step=validate - this seems to be specifically for validation, not for creating new configurations.\n\nI should inform the user that the current stage (VALIDATE) is limited to read-only operations and validation. To create new pages, points, and bindings, we would need to switch to a different workflow/stage that supports configuration creation. Let me suggest switching to ANALYZE_INTENT as that's the available next stage."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1916, "output_tokens": 316, "latency_ms": 6361.355100001674, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目是**空项目**——没有页面也没有点位。要完成您的需求，需要切换到支持配置创建的阶段。\n\n建议切换到 **ANALYZE_INTENT** 阶段，以便系统能规划并执行以下任务：\n\n| 任务 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 🖥️ 新建HMI画面 | 创建\"反应釜综合监控\"画面，放置罐体/仪表控件 |\n| 📊 创建三个IO点位 | `REACTOR_TEMP`（温度）、`REACTOR_PRESS`（压力）、`REACTOR_LEVEL`（液位）|\n| 🔗 绑定数据源 | 将点位绑定到画面对应的罐子和仪表控件 |\n| ✅ 校验并部署 | 运行一致性校验，通过后下装 |\n\n---\n\n**请确认：是否要我切换到 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段开始规划创建？** 确认后我将帮您逐步完成整个反应釜监控方案的配置。\n\nnext_state: ANALYZE_INTENT", "reasoning": "The project is currently empty - no pages and no points. To create the reactor monitoring solution, we need to switch to a different stage that supports creation operations.\n\nLooking at the available next stages: ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n\nANALYZE_INTENT seems like the right choice to start planning and then move to a creation stage. Let me suggest switching to ANALYZE_INTENT."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2286, "output_tokens": 877, "latency_ms": 16891.181199986022, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解已经切换到 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，但需要向您说明当前的实际情况：\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 当前阶段限制分析\n\n当前阶段（ANALYZE_INTENT）可用的工具**仅支持只读操作**：\n\n| 工具 | 当前允许的操作 | 能否创建？ |\n|------|---------------|-----------|\n| `manage_pages` | `list_pages` | ❌ 只能查看 |\n| `manage_points` | `list_points` | ❌ 只能查看 |\n| `manage_scripts` | `list_scripts` | ❌ 只能查看 |\n| `manage_history` | `list_history` | ❌ 只能查看 |\n| `deployment` | `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project` | ❌ 只能校验/查看 |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 问题说明\n\n要完成您的反应釜监控方案，需要以下创建类工具，但**当前阶段不可用**：\n\n- **创建页面** → 需要 `create_page` / `add_page` 类工具\n- **创建点位** → 需要 `create_point` / `add_point` 类工具  \n- **绑定控件** 需要 `bind_point` / `configure_widget` 类工具\n\n---\n\n## 💡 建议\n\n此 SCADA 配置工作流可能需要切换到 **配置编辑阶段**（如 `CONFIG_POINT`、`MANAGE_PAGES`、`BIND_POINTS` 等）才能获得写操作权限。\n\n**请问系统是否可以提供上述创建类工具的访问权限？** 或者是否需要我切换到其他特定阶段来继续？根据流程图，以下阶段可能更合适：\n\n- `CONFIG_POINT` → 创建点位\n- `MANAGE_PAGES` → 创建页面\n- `BIND_POINTS` → 绑定点位到控件\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "The user says I've entered the ANALYZE_INTENT stage. Let me check what tools are available in this stage.\n\nLooking at the system prompt again, it says:\n- Current stage: VALIDATE\n- Available next stages: ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n\nBut the user says I'm now in ANALYZE_INTENT stage. However, the system prompt still shows the same available tools:\n- manage_pages: list_pages only\n- manage_history: list_history only\n- deployment: show_deployment_status, validate_project\n- manage_scripts: list_scripts only\n- manage_points: list_points only\n\nThese are still read-only actions. To actually CREATE pages, points, and bindings, I would need tools like:\n- create_page\n- create_point\n- bind_point\n- etc.\n\nBut these aren't available in the current tool set. The tools available only support list/show operations.\n\nI need to inform the user that even in ANALYZE_INTENT stage, the available tools don't support creation operations. The current tool set is limited to read-only operations and validation.\n\nLet me think about what I can do:\n1. I can only call tools that are available\n2. The available tools only support read operations (list, show, validate)\n3. I cannot create pages, points, or bindings with the current toolset\n\nI should be transparent with the user about this limitation. The system might need to be in a different stage or have different tools enabled to support the creation workflow.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the prompt. It says \"当前可用工具\" and lists specific tools with specific allowed actions. These are the ONLY tools I can use. I cannot make up new tools or actions.\n\nSo even though the user says I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT, the available actions haven't changed. I still can't create anything.\n\nI should explain this to the user - that the current tool configuration only allows read-only operations, and to complete their request, we would need access to creation tools (like create_page, create_point, bind_point_to_widget, etc.) which aren't currently available in this stage.\n\n\nThere's a disconnect between what the workflow expects and what the toolset actually supports. I need to be direct with the user about this mismatch."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3160, "output_tokens": 929, "latency_ms": 31831.32289996138, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **ASK_USER** 阶段。在继续之前，我需要向您确认一些关键信息，以确保配置准确：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 反应釜监控方案需求确认\n\n### 1️⃣ 点位规格\n\n| 点位 | 建议ID | 数据类型 | 单位 | 范围（示例） | 是否确认？ |\n|------|--------|---------|------|-------------|-----------|\n| 温度 | `REACTOR_TEMP` | REAL | ℃ | 0~300 | ？ |\n| 压力 | `REACTOR_PRESS` | REAL | MPa | 0~2.5 | ？ |\n| 液位 | `REACTOR_LEVEL` | REAL | % | 0~100 | ？ |\n\n### 2️⃣ 画面规格\n\n- **画面名称**：建议 `\"反应釜综合监控\"`\n- **画面分辨率**：建议 `1920×1080`\n- **控件需求**：\n  - 🛢️ 储罐/反应釜图示 ×1\n  - 🌡️ 温度仪表 ×1\n  - 📊 压力仪表 ×1\n  - 📏 液位条 ×1\n  - 是否需要其他控件？（阀门、管道、报警灯等）\n\n### 3️⃣ 数据源\n\n- 这些点位连接的是 **PLC/DCS** 还是 **模拟数据**？\n- 通信协议：Modbus / OPC UA / 其他？\n\n---\n\n**请回复确认或修改以上参数**，确认后我将为您规划完整的配置步骤。\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm in ASK_USER stage now. But looking at the system prompt, the available tools haven't changed - they're still the same read-only tools. Let me check the current available tools again:\n\nCurrent stage: ASK_USER\nAvailable next stages: ANALYZE_INTENT, DONE\nCurrent available tools (only these can be called):\n- manage_pages: list_pages only\n- manage_history: list_history only\n- deployment: show_deployment_status, validate_project\n- manage_scripts: list_scripts only\n- manage_points: list_points only\n\nWait, I need to re-read the original system prompt more carefully. It says:\n\n【当前阶段】VALIDATE\n【可切换的下一阶段】ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- manage_pages: Create, edit, delete, list HMI pages and widgets.; 当前允许 actions: list_pages\n- manage_history: historical storage: storage, query, export, archiving.; 当前允许 actions: list_history\n- deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status.; 当前允许 actions: show_deployment_status, validate_project\n- manage_scripts: Create, edit, delete, list scripts.; 当前允许 actions: list_scripts\n- manage_points: Create, edit, delete, list points and tags.; 当前允许 actions: list_points\n\nSo the tools themselves support more actions (like create, edit, delete), but only specific actions are allowed in the current stage.\n\nNow the user says I'm in ASK_USER stage, but the system prompt hasn't changed to reflect what actions are available in ASK_USER. I should work with what I have.\n\nSince I'm in ASK_USER and the tools available are still the same read-only ones, I need to ask the user what they want to do. The purpose of ASK_USER stage is typically to gather requirements or confirm with the user.\n\n\nI should ask clarifying questions to better understand what the user needs. Since we've established the project is empty and we need to create a reactor monitoring solution with temperature, pressure, and level points bound to a page with appropriate widgets, I should confirm the specific details they're looking for - things like naming conventions, point configurations, widget types, and any other requirements before we proceed with the configuration.\n\nHowever, I'm realizing the current stage might not support the write operations needed to actually create these elements. I should clarify with the user whether they want me to guide them through the manual steps or if they'd prefer to wait until I'm in a stage with the proper tooling to handle creation tasks."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8997, "output_tokens": 2808, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 75957.01260003261}, "judge": null}
