ferenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}, {"turn": 5, "state": "CONFIG_POINT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 2.148600004147738, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1635, "output_tokens": 606, "latency_ms": 19529.24989996245, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您创建反应釜综合监控方案！这是一个完整的配置任务，让我先了解一下当前项目状态。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a comprehensive reactor monitoring solution. Let me break down what they're asking:\n\n1. Create a new HMI page\n2. Create three points (temperature, pressure, level)\n3. Bind these points to widgets (tank and instruments) on the page\n4. Deploy and validate\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools, I'm in the VALIDATE stage, and the available tools are limited to:\n- manage_pages: only `list_pages` action\n- manage_history: only `list_history` action\n- deployment: `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project`\n- manage_scripts: only `list_scripts` action\n- manage_points: only `list_points` action\n\nSo I can't actually CREATE pages, CREATE points, or BIND widgets right now. These would require different actions (like `create_point`, `create_page`, `bind_widget`) that aren't available in my current stage.\n\nLet me think about what I should do:\n\n1. First, I should check the current state of the project by listing existing pages, points, etc.\n2. Then I should explain to the user that I need to switch to a different stage to perform the creation operations, OR if there's a more appropriate workflow stage.\n\nActually, looking at the workflow context: `workflow=DeploymentCheck, step=validate` - this is a deployment check workflow. The user's request is more about project configuration/creation, which would require different stages.\n\nThe user wants to:\n- Create pages (need create_page action)\n- Create points (need create_point action)\n- Bind widgets (need bind action)\n- Deploy and validate\n\nCurrently I can only list/read things, not create them. The available actions are:\n- list_pages (not create)\n- list_points (not create)\n- list_scripts (not create)\n- list_history (not create)\n- show_deployment_status, validate_project\n\n\nI'm constrained by my current stage's limited actions, so I can't perform the creation operations needed. The logical next stages available are ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, or DONE - but I should first gather information about the existing project state to understand what's already configured and what needs to be built.\n\nLet me start by querying the current pages and points to see what infrastructure exists. This will help me determine whether the creation tools are available in a different stage or if I need to guide the user through the configuration process differently. I'll retrieve the existing pages and points to understand the current state before proceeding."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1873, "output_tokens": 867, "latency_ms": 15825.536499964073, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目是**空白项目**（无画面、无点位），处于草稿状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📋 需求分析\n\n您要创建的反应釜监控方案包括：\n\n| 序号 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|:---:|------|------|\n| 1 | 🖥️ 新建画面 | 反应釜综合监控页面 |\n| 2 | 📊 创建点位 | 温度、压力、液位（3个IO点） |\n| 3 | 🔗 绑定控件 | 点位绑定到罐体和仪表控件 |\n| 4 | ✅ 验证下发 | 校验项目并部署 |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 当前阶段限制\n\n我目前处于 **VALIDATE（验证阶段）**，此阶段仅支持：\n- ✅ 查看项目状态\n- ✅ 运行一致性校验\n- ❌ **无法创建画面、点位或绑定控件**\n\n这些配置操作需要在 **CONFIGURE（配置阶段）** 完成。\n\n---\n\n## 💡 建议方案\n\n我建议采用以下方式帮您完成：\n\n**方式一：切换到配置阶段**（推荐）\n您可以在项目配置工具中先完成以下操作，然后我来帮您校验和部署：\n1. 创建画面 `ReactorMonitor`\n2. 添加点位：`TT-101`（温度）、`PT-101`（压力）、`LT-101`（液位）\n3. 在画面上放置罐体和仪表控件，并绑定点位\n4. 完成后回来找我执行验证和部署\n\n**方式二：先验证当前项目**\n我可以先执行一次项目校验，确认当前状态是否满足部署条件。\n\n---\n\n请问您希望我先执行**项目验证**，还是您先去完成配置后再回来？\n\nnext_state: ANALYZE_INTENT", "reasoning": "Okay, so:\n- No existing pages\n- No existing points\n- Project is in \"draft\" status\n\nThe user wants to:\n1. Create a new page (for reactor monitoring)\n2. Create 3 points (temperature, pressure, level)\n3. Bind points to widgets (tank and instruments)\n4. Deploy and validate\n\nHowever, I'm in the VALIDATE stage and I only have read-only actions available. I cannot create pages or points with my current tools. \n\nI need to switch to a different stage that allows creation operations. Looking at my options:\n- ANALYZE_INTENT\n- DEPLOY\n- DONE\n\nNone of these seem like the right stage for creation either. The ANALYZE_INTENT stage might help with understanding intent, but probably doesn't have creation tools either.\n\nWait, let me re-read the instructions. It says:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nSo I should suggest switching to a stage that would have the creation tools. But looking at the available stages (ANALYZE_INTENT, DEPLOY, DONE), none of them explicitly mention creation capabilities.\n\nActually, I think the system might be designed such that different stages have different capabilities. The VALIDATE stage is specifically for validation before deployment. The user's request is fundamentally about project configuration which might need to happen before the VALIDATE stage.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about the situation - I can validate the project, but the current stage doesn't support creating new pages and points. I should explain this and suggest the appropriate action.\n\nActually, looking more carefully - maybe I should just tell the user what I CAN do (validate) and what I CANNOT do (create pages/points) in this stage. Then I can offer to validate the project, or suggest switching stages.\n\n\nThis is a new project that needs to be configured from scratch. I should explain that my current VALIDATE stage has limited capabilities and offer to either switch to a different stage or help them understand what configuration would need to happen first before I can assist further."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2794, "output_tokens": 483, "latency_ms": 14914.832399983425, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段**。让我先分析当前项目状态，确定完成您的需求需要什么。", "reasoning": "The user is telling me that I'm now in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage. But looking at my available tools, they're still the same:\n- manage_pages: only `list_pages` action\n- manage_history: only `list_history` action\n- deployment: `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project`\n- manage_scripts: only `list_scripts` action\n- manage_points: only `list_points` action\n\nSo even in ANALYZE_INTENT stage, I still don't have tools to CREATE pages, CREATE points, or BIND widgets. The available actions are still read-only.\n\nI should be honest with the user - the current available tools don't include creation capabilities. I can only list/validate things.\n\nLet me check what I can do:\n1. I can validate the project (validate_project action)\n2. I can show deployment status\n3. I can list pages, points, scripts, history\n\nFor the user's request to \"建一个反应釜综合监控方案\" (create a reactor monitoring solution), I need creation tools that aren't available.\n\nI should inform the user that the current stage's available tools are limited to read-only operations and validation, and I cannot create pages, points, or bindings with these tools.\n\nHowever, I notice that the instructions say I should try to complete the task with available tools. Let me think about what I CAN do:\n\n1. I can validate the project to check its current state\n2. I can list what exists\n\nBut I cannot CREATE anything. So I should be transparent about this limitation.\n\nLet me run a validation to show the user the current state and explain what's missing."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3467, "output_tokens": 573, "latency_ms": 14775.136500014924, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "## 📊 意图分析结果\n\n| 项目 | 当前状态 |\n|------|----------|\n| 画面 | 0 个 |\n| 点位 | 0 个 |\n| 脚本 | 0 个 |\n| 历史记录 | 0 条 |\n| 部署状态 | 草稿 (draft) |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 意图识别\n\n您需要完成 **5 项配置任务**，当前阶段可用工具均为**只读查询工具**，无法执行创建操作。\n\n需要依次切换到以下阶段：\n\n| 步骤 | 目标阶段 | 任务内容 |\n|:---:|----------|----------|\n| 1 | CONFIG_POINT | 创建 3 个点位（温度/压力/液位） |\n| 2 | MANAGE_PAGES | 新建反应釜监控画面 |\n| 3 | BIND_POINTS | 将点位绑定到画面控件 |\n| 4 | VALIDATE | 校验项目完整性 |\n| 5 | DEPLOY | 下发部署 |\n\n---\n\n我将开始切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段来创建点位。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "The user is repeating that I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage and asking me to continue. Let me look at my available tools again:\n\n- manage_pages: only `list_pages` action\n- manage_history: only `list_history` action\n- deployment: `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project`\n- manage_scripts: only `list_scripts` action\n- manage_points: only `list_points` action\n\nThe problem is clear: I don't have any creation tools available. All I can do is list/validate. The user wants to:\n1. Create a page - no create_page tool available\n2. Create points - no create_point tool available\n3. Bind widgets - no bind tool available\n\nI've already listed everything and confirmed the project is empty. \n\nI should be direct with the user: the current stage's tools are read-only and validation-only. I cannot create pages, points, or bindings. I need to switch to a different stage that has creation capabilities.\n\nLooking at the available next states: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nThese seem like stages I can switch to! Let me switch to the appropriate ones:\n- CONFIG_POINT - for creating points\n- MANAGE_PAGES - for creating pages\n- BIND_POINTS - for binding widgets\n\nI should switch to these stages to complete the task. Let me start with CONFIG_POINT to create the three points (temperature, pressure, level)."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4055, "output_tokens": 505, "latency_ms": 14628.597900038585, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我现在进入 **CONFIG_POINT 阶段**，开始为您创建反应釜监控所需的三个点位。", "reasoning": "The user says I'm now in CONFIG_POINT stage. Let me check what tools are available now. I should look at the tools available for this stage.\n\nLooking at my available tools, I still see the same tools:\n- manage_pages: only `list_pages` action\n- manage_history: only `list_history` action\n- deployment: `show_deployment_status`, `validate_project`\n- manage_scripts: only `list_scripts` action\n- manage_points: only `list_points` action\n\nHmm, the tools haven't changed. I still only have list_points, not create_point. \n\nWait, but the user is telling me I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage now. Maybe the tools are supposed to be different but I'm still seeing the old ones? Let me work with what I have.\n\nActually, I think the system is telling me what stage I'm in, but the actual tool capabilities haven't changed in my available tools list. The `manage_points` tool only has `list_points` action available.\n\nI should be honest with the user - even in CONFIG_POINT stage, my available tools for manage_points only include `list_points`, not `create_point` or similar creation actions.\n\nLet me try to call manage_points to see what happens, or I should explain the limitation to the user.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the tool definition. The manage_points tool says \"Currently allowed actions: list_points\". This is a constraint on what actions I can take.\n\nI should inform the user that even though I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage, the available actions for the manage_points tool are still limited to `list_points`. I cannot create points with the current tool configuration.\n\nHowever, maybe the system expects me to proceed and the tool actions might have changed? Let me try to be helpful. I'll list the points again to confirm the current state, and explain that I need create_point action to proceed.\n\nActually, I think I should just be transparent - the tool definition explicitly states only `list_points` is allowed. I cannot fabricate a `create_point` action that doesn't exist.\n\n\nSince the tool only supports listing points, I should acknowledge this constraint to the user and clarify that creating points isn't currently possible with the available actions."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4619, "output_tokens": 649, "latency_ms": 11955.70150000276, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您希望我继续，但我需要向您说明当前的技术限制：\n\n## ⚠️ 工具限制说明\n\n当前 **CONFIG_POINT 阶段** 配置的 `manage_points` 工具**仅允许以下操作**：\n\n| 可用操作 | 不可用操作 |\n|----------|------------|\n| ✅ `list_points` (查看点位列表) | ❌ `create_point` (创建点位) |\n| | ❌ `update_point` (修改点位) |\n| | ❌ `delete_point` (删除点位) |\n\n---\n\n## 🚧 问题\n\n我**无法执行创建点位操作**，因为工具定义中未开放 `create_point` 权限。这属于系统工具配置层面的限制，而非我主观拒绝执行。\n\n---\n\n## 💡 建议\n\n要继续完成您的反应釜监控方案，有以下选项：\n\n1. **手动预配置点位** — 您在 SCADA 工程软件中手动创建以下点位，然后我来帮您验证和部署：\n   - `TT-101` (温度)\n   - `PT-101` (压力)  \n   - `LT-101` (液位)\n\n2. **联系系统管理员** — 请为 CONFIG_POINT 阶段开放 `create_point` 工具权限\n\n3. **切换到其他阶段** — 如 VALIDATE 阶段，我可以先执行项目校验\n\n请问您希望如何处理？", "reasoning": "The user keeps telling me I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage, but my available tools for manage_points only include `list_points` action. I cannot create points with the current tool configuration.\n\nLooking at the system prompt again:\n```\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- manage_points: Point management.; 当前允许 actions: list_points\n```\n\nThe tool explicitly only allows `list_points`. I cannot call `create_point` or any other action because it's not in the allowed actions list.\n\nI need to be honest with the user about this limitation. The tool definition restricts me to only listing points, not creating them. I should explain this clearly and ask for guidance on how to proceed.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the instructions more carefully. It says:\n\"【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\" and then lists the tools with their allowed actions.\n\nFor manage_points, it says \"当前允许 actions: list_points\" - this means I can ONLY use list_points action.\n\nI cannot invent or use a `create_point` action because:\n1. It's not in the allowed actions list\n2. The instructions say \"禁止编造工具名\" (don't fabricate tool names)\n\nI should be transparent with the user that the current stage's tool configuration doesn't include creation capabilities. Maybe the system needs to be configured differently, or maybe there's a different workflow needed.\n\nLet me just be direct and tell the user that I cannot create points because the manage_points tool only allows list_points action in this stage."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 18443, "output_tokens": 3683, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 91689.64850000339}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "94039d28-5a3c-44fe-9bc6-c501e1b9ff43", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-027", "text": "批量生成PT-100到PT-110这11个点，全配上H和HH报警，并且统统挂到历史库里存储模式设为周期，1秒一次", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T13:08:07.944Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T13:08:46.912Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T13:08:07.944Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:08:25.261Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T13:08:25.262Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:08:46.912Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1038000229746103, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 477, "latency_ms": 17308.754800003953, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求批量创建PT-100到PT-110这11个点，并配置高限（H）和高高限（HH）报警，同时将这些点连接到历史数据库，存储模式设为周期，每秒一次。\n\n首先，我需要理解当前的工作流程上下文：当前处于\"ANALYZE_INTENT\"阶段，可切换到其他阶段，如\"CONFIG_POINT\"、\"CONFIG_ALARM\"、\"CONFIG_HISTORY\"等。当前可用的工具只有\"manage_points\"和\"manage_pages\"，且仅支持\"list_points\"和\"list_pages\"操作。\n\n用户的需求涉及多个步骤：\n1. 批量创建11个点（PT-100到PT-110）。\n2. 为这些点配置H和HH报警。\n3. 将这些点添加到历史数据库，并设置存储模式为周期，间隔1秒。\n\n然而，当前可用的工具仅支持列出点和页面，不支持创建点、配置报警或设置历史存储。因此，我需要切换到其他阶段，以便使用相应的工具来完成这些操作。\n\n根据可切换的下一阶段列表，我可以选择：\n- CONFIG_POINT：用于创建和配置点。\n- CONFIG_ALARM：用于配置报警。\n- CONFIG_HISTORY：用于配置历史存储。\n\n考虑到用户需求涉及点创建、报警配置和历史存储，我需要按顺序处理这些步骤。但首先，我需要切换到\"CONFIG_POINT\"阶段，以便创建这些点。不过，在切换之前，我应该先确认当前项目中是否已存在这些点，以避免重复创建。我可以使用\"list_points\"工具来检查。\n\n因此，我将先调用\"list_points\"工具，过滤类型为\"analog\"（因为PT-100到PT-110很可能是模拟量点）。如果不存在这些点，再进行下一步。\n\n但根据行为准则，若信息不足，应先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。这里，我需要了解当前项目中是否已存在这些点。所以，我会先调用\"list_points\"工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2356, "output_tokens": 737, "latency_ms": 21638.083400030155, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，只能管理报警，无法创建点位。要完成您的需求，需要先创建 PT-100 到 PT-110 这 11 个模拟量点。建议切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段创建这些点，然后返回 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段配置 H 和 HH 报警。之后还需要切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段配置历史存储。\n\n是否同意切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段？\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "用户要求批量创建PT-100到PT-110这11个点，并配置H和HH报警，同时将这些点连接到历史数据库，存储模式设为周期，每秒一次。\n\n当前处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可用的工具有manage_alarms（允许的操作包括create_digital_alarm、create_analog_alarm等）和manage_points（仅允许list_points）。\n\n然而，要完成这个任务，首先需要创建这些点。但当前阶段无法创建点，因为manage_points只允许list_points操作。要创建点，需要切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。但根据用户指令，我目前处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，需要使用当前可用工具继续完成任务。\n\n用户指令是“批量生成PT-100到PT-110这11个点，全配上H和HH报警，并且统统挂到历史库里存储模式设为周期，1秒一次”。要完成这个任务，需要多个步骤：\n1. 创建点（PT-100到PT-110）。\n2. 为每个点配置H和HH报警。\n3. 将这些点添加到历史库，设置存储模式为周期，间隔1秒。\n\n但当前阶段只能管理报警，无法创建点。因此，我需要切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段来创建点。根据行为准则第5条：“若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。”\n\n所以，我应该回复用户，说明当前阶段无法创建点，需要切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段。在回复中包含“next_state: CONFIG_POINT”。\n\n另外，根据高危操作安全准则，批量操作可能需要谨慎。但创建点并配置报警通常不算高危操作，除非有明确的风险。不过，这里没有提到强制或跳过校验等高风险行为，所以应该可以继续。\n\n因此，我的回复应该是：先说明当前阶段只能管理报警，无法创建点，建议切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段创建点，然后再回到CONFIG_ALARM阶段配置报警。并在回复中包含“next_state: CONFIG_POINT”。\n\n同时，我需要确认用户是否同意切换。根据行为准则，我需要先向用户确认。但用户已经明确要求批量生成点并配置报警，所以直接建议切换阶段是合理的。\n\n因此，我将回复如下：\n\n\"当前处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，只能管理报警，无法创建点位。要完成您的需求，需要先创建 PT-100 到 PT-110 这 11 个模拟量点。建议切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段创建这些点，然后返回 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段配置 H 和 HH 报警。之后还需要切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段配置历史存储。是否同意切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段？\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT\"\n\n这样既符合行为准则，也推进了任务。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3344, "output_tokens": 1214, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 38967.50480000628}, "judge": null}
