ch_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3432, "output_tokens": 526, "latency_ms": 11946.099099994171, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来帮你创建几个常见的工业传感器点位，涵盖不同类型：\n\n1. **温度传感器** (TEMP_001) - 模拟量，单位℃\n2. **压力传感器** (PRESS_001) - 模拟量，单位 kPa\n3. **液位传感器** (LEVEL_001) - 模拟量，单位 %\n4. **运行状态** (RUN_STATUS_001) - 数字量（开/关）", "reasoning": "The user wants me to add some sensor points with names and types that I decide. Let me create a few typical sensor points that would be common in a SCADA system.\n\nI'll create a few different types:\n1. An analog temperature sensor\n2. An analog pressure sensor\n3. A digital sensor (like a door switch or motion detector)\n4. An analog level/flow sensor\n\nThese are common industrial sensors. Let me create them."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4082, "output_tokens": 281, "latency_ms": 8205.827800033148, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 成功创建了 **4 个传感器点位**，汇总如下：\n\n| 标签名 | 类型 | 单位 | 量程 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|------|------|\n| `TEMP_001` | 模拟量 (analog) | ℃ | -40 ~ 150 | 温度传感器 - 管道温度 |\n| `PRESS_001` | 模拟量 (analog) | kPa | 0 ~ 1000 | 压力传感器 - 管道压力 |\n| `LEVEL_001` | 模拟量 (analog) | % | 0 ~ 100 | 液位传感器 - 储罐液位 |\n| `RUN_STATUS_001` | 数字量 (digital) | — | — | 设备运行状态 (ON/OFF) |\n\n这些点位已经可以在后续配置中用于：\n- 📊 HMI 页面绑定显示\n- ⚠️ 配置报警规则\n- 📈 设置历史数据记录\n\n需要进一步配置什么吗？比如给这些点添加报警、绑定到 HMI 页面等。", "reasoning": "All four points were created successfully. Let me summarize what was created for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7514, "output_tokens": 807, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20181.759600003716}, "judge": null}
