eason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先确认点位 PT_COMP_01 是否存在，让我查询一下当前的点位列表。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure alarms for point PT_COMP_01:\n- H (High) alarm = 2.8, severity = medium\n- HH (High-High) alarm = 3.2, severity = high\n\nFirst, I need to verify that the point PT_COMP_01 exists in the system. Let me check the available points.\n\nAccording to the current phase (ANALYZE_INTENT), I should analyze the user's intent and then proceed. The user wants to configure alarms, so I need to:\n1. First verify the point exists\n2. Then configure the alarms\n\nLet me first list the points to verify PT_COMP_01 exists."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2089, "output_tokens": 318, "latency_ms": 5448.314699984621, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 PT_COMP_01 确认存在，是一个模拟量点位（单位: MPa）。现在为您配置 H 和 HH 报警：", "reasoning": "点位 PT_COMP_01 存在，是一个模拟量点位（analog），单位是 MPa。现在我需要为它配置两个报警：\n1. H（高）报警：阈值 = 2.8，优先级 = medium\n2. HH（高高）报警：阈值 = 3.2，优先级 = high\n\n我需要使用 create_analog_alarm 动作来创建这两个报警。这两个报警的创建是相互独立的，可以同时调用。\n\n报警ID命名规范，我用：\n- alarm_PT_COMP_01_H\n- alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3738, "output_tokens": 384, "latency_ms": 10336.50650002528, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "PT_COMP_01 的报警配置已完成！以下是配置结果汇总：\n\n| 报警ID | 点位 | 报警类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|----------|------|--------|------|\n| alarm_PT_COMP_01_H | PT_COMP_01 | H（高报警） | 2.8 MPa | medium | ✅ 已创建 |\n| alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH | PT_COMP_01 | HH（高高报警） | 3.2 MPa | high | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n当前处于 **CONFIG_ALARM** 阶段，您可以：\n- 继续配置其他报警\n- 配置报警通知规则\n- 或切换到下一阶段（如 VALIDATE 校验、DEPLOY 下装等）\n\n请问还需要做什么？", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to continue in the CONFIG_ALARM phase. Looking at the previous conversation, I have already successfully configured the two alarms for PT_COMP_01:\n1. alarm_PT_COMP_01_H (H alarm, threshold 2.8, medium priority)\n2. alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH (HH alarm, threshold 3.2, high priority)\n\nBoth alarms were created successfully. The user's original request has been fulfilled. \n\nNow the system is prompting me that I'm in the CONFIG_ALARM phase. I should inform the user that the alarm configuration is complete and ask if they need anything else, or if they want to proceed to the next phase.\n\nLooking at the available next states: BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nSince the alarm configuration task is complete, I should let the user know and ask if they want to continue with other configurations or move to validation/deployment."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6799, "output_tokens": 890, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25437.022200028878}, "judge": null}
