n然后创建第二个报警（HH=3.2，high优先级）。这次我只指定high_limit，其他参数用默认值。low_limit默认也是null。\n\n开始创建。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5583, "output_tokens": 152, "latency_ms": 5446.552100009285, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要创建两个模拟报警：H=2.8（medium优先级）和HH=3.2（high优先级）。错误提示low_limit应该是一个数字或null，不能是字符串\"None\"。让我用null值再试一次。"}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5809, "output_tokens": 455, "latency_ms": 13622.816500021145, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要为PT_COMP_01配置H和HH报警，H=2.8 medium，HH=3.2 high。我需要使用manage_alarms工具来创建这两个报警。\n\n首先，我需要创建两个模拟报警：一个高限值报警（H=2.8，medium优先级）和一个高高限值报警（HH=3.2，high优先级）。每个报警都需要一个唯一的ID。\n\n我打算创建两个报警：\n1. ID: alarm_PT_COMP_01_H, tag: PT_COMP_01, high_limit: 2.8, priority: medium\n2. ID: alarm_PT_COMP_01_HH, tag: PT_COMP_01, high_limit: 3.2, priority: high\n\n之前尝试时遇到了low_limit参数的问题。根据JSON模式，low_limit应该是一个数字或null。但当我传递\"None\"（字符串）时，它期望的是一个数字。我需要检查JSON模式：low_limit是anyOf: [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]。这意味着它应该是数字或JSON null。但在工具调用中，我传递的是字符串\"None\"，而不是null。我需要传递JSON null值。在JSON中，null是一个关键字。但在Python的JSON中，它是None。然而，在工具调用中，我需要传递一个真正的null值，而不是字符串。让我试试看传递null值，不带引号。在JSON中，null是有效的。所以low_limit: null。\n\n另外，我也可以完全省略low_limit参数，因为它有默认值null。但为了清晰起见，我会明确指定它为null。\n\n让我先尝试创建第一个报警。"}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6338, "output_tokens": 257, "latency_ms": 8319.871100015007, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要创建两个模拟报警：H和HH。H报警阈值2.8，优先级medium；HH报警阈值3.2，优先级high。我需要为每个报警指定唯一的ID。首先创建H报警。工具要求low_limit不能是字符串\"None\"，应该是数字或null。我应该不提供low_limit，或者设置为null。让我试试不提供low_limit参数。但工具模式要求所有参数都必须提供，除了那些有默认值的。low_limit的默认值是null，所以我可以不提供它，但模式中它是可选的。在create_analog_alarm模式中，low_limit的anyOf包括null，且默认值为null。所以我不需要提供它。我将尝试只提供必需参数：action、id、tag、high_limit、priority。其他参数有默认值。让我试试。"}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6669, "output_tokens": 202, "latency_ms": 5724.4872999726795, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我明白了，问题出在low_limit参数。让我看看这个工具的参数定义。根据工具的JSON Schema，low_limit的类型是anyOf: [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}]，默认值是null。所以当我传递\"None\"字符串时，它被解释为字符串而不是null。我需要传递一个真正的null值或者省略这个参数。在JSON中，null应该表示为null（不带引号），但在这个工具调用中，参数是通过JSON传递的。让我尝试不提供low_limit参数，因为它的默认值是null。"}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6945, "output_tokens": 123, "latency_ms": 4823.294800007716, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "看起来系统在解析JSON时有问题。让我尝试另一种方式，显式地传递low_limit为null（在JSON中应该表示为null，而不是字符串\"None\"）。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 53550, "output_tokens": 3245, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 108105.13520002132}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "60559647-ee93-481e-adb1-5f98c0bdba71", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-043", "text": "把TEMP_ZONE_1现有高温报警优先级从medium提升到high", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T13:20:32.311Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T13:20:53.536Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T13:20:32.311Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:20:40.097Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T13:20:40.097Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:20:53.536Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TEMP_ZONE_1", "type": "analog", "unit": "°C", "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1508000316098332, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_hash": "sha256:675bf98eb06d57e159eb3b1b3589bda0f2ab5cfda504bb0a5a3b4f7e7cec7f3c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 962, "output_tokens": 228, "latency_ms": 7781.6288999747485, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您查找 TEMP_ZONE_1 点位的当前配置信息。首先让我查看系统中现有的点位。", "reasoning": "The user wants to modify an existing high temperature alarm for TEMP_ZONE_1, changing its priority from medium to high. This is an alarm configuration task.\n\nLet me think about what I need to do:\n1. First, I need to discover what points exist in the system, specifically looking for TEMP_ZONE_1\n2. Then I need to configure the alarm settings\n\nCurrently, I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage with the AlarmConfig workflow at the discover_points step. The available tools are:\n- manage_pages (list_pages action only)\n- manage_points (list_points action only)\n\nLet me first list the points to find TEMP_ZONE_1 and understand the current configuration. This will help me understand what needs to be changed.\n\nI should call manage_points to list the points and find TEMP_ZONE_1."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2118, "output_tokens": 454, "latency_ms": 13432.933299976867, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我找到了 TEMP_ZONE_1 点位，它是模拟量点位（°C）。\n\n不过需要向您说明一个情况：**当前可用的报警管理工具没有直接修改报警优先级的功能**。\n\n根据工具能力，可用的操作包括：\n- `set_threshold` — 只能修改阈值（high_limit / low_limit / deadband）\n- `create_analog_alarm` — 创建新报警\n- `delete_alarm` — 删除报警\n- `disable_alarm` / `enable_alarm` — 禁用/启用报警\n\n**如需修改优先级，需要通过以下方式间接实现：**\n1. 删除现有的高温报警\n2. 重新创建一个相同配置但优先级为 high 的新报警\n\n这是一个**删除+重建**的操作，原报警的报警历史记录关联可能会丢失。\n\n请问：\n1. **现有高温报警的 ID 是什么？**（例如 `alarm_temp_high_zone1`）\n2. **您是否确认执行删除并重建操作？**", "reasoning": "用户想要修改TEMP_ZONE_1的现有高温报警，将优先级从medium提升到high。\n\n当前阶段是CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具是：\n- manage_alarms: 可以进行 set_threshold, create_analog_alarm, disable_alarm, delete_alarm, enable_alarm, create_digital_alarm\n- manage_points: 只能 list_points\n\n问题是：manage_alarms工具没有直接的\"update priority\"或\"update alarm\"功能。可用的actions是：\n- set_threshold: 只能更新阈值/死区\n- create_analog_alarm: 创建新报警\n- disable_alarm: 禁用报警\n- delete_alarm: 删除报警\n- enable_alarm: 启用报警\n- create_digital_alarm: 创建数字报警\n\n没有直接修改报警优先级的功能。我需要向用户说明这个限制。\n\n根据工具的schema，set_threshold只能更新high_limit, low_limit和deadband，不能更新priority。\n\n我应该向用户说明当前工具不支持直接修改报警优先级，只能通过\"删除旧报警并创建新报警\"的方式间接实现，但这涉及到删除操作，需要用户确认。\n\n让我向用户解释这个情况。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3080, "output_tokens": 682, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21225.37659999216}, "judge": null}
