s": 3488.6954000103287, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元创建成功！现在绑定两个点位：", "reasoning": "The pump widget was created successfully. Now I need to bind the two points:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN → pump_a.running\n2. PUMP_A_HZ → pump_a.frequency\n\nThese two bindings are independent, so I can call them in parallel."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4545, "output_tokens": 249, "latency_ms": 6563.032000034582, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 汇总如下：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `pump_panel`（泵面板） |\n| **图元** | `pump_a`（泵类型），位置 (200,200)，尺寸 160×160，标签\"泵A\" |\n| **绑定 1** | `pump_a.running` ← `PUMP_A_RUN`（运行状态，数字量） |\n| **绑定 2** | `pump_a.frequency` ← `PUMP_A_HZ`（频率，模拟量，Hz） |\n\n现在 `pump_panel` 页面上的泵A图元会实时反映 `PUMP_A_RUN` 的启停状态和 `PUMP_A_HZ` 的频率值。如需调整位置、样式或添加更多图元，请告诉我。", "reasoning": "All three operations completed successfully:\n1. Created pump widget (pump_a) on pump_panel page\n2. Bound PUMP_A_RUN to pump_a.running\n3. Bound PUMP_A_HZ to pump_a.frequency\n\nI should summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 13649, "output_tokens": 943, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23622.984800022095}, "judge": null}
