点位 `NO_SUCH_TEMP` 是否存在于系统中。让我查询一下当前所有点位。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure a high-temperature alarm for a point called \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" with a threshold of 90. Let me first check if this point exists in the system by listing all points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1982, "output_tokens": 285, "latency_ms": 5177.737599995453, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据查询结果，当前系统中**不存在** `NO_SUCH_TEMP` 这个点位。系统中目前只有一个点位：\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 单位 |\n|---------|------|------|\n| TEMP_REAL | analog（模拟量） | °C |\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **无法执行此操作**\n\n报警（Alarm）必须关联到一个**已存在的 SCADA 点位**才能生效。`NO_SUCH_TEMP` 不存在于系统中，因此无法为其创建高温报警。\n\n**您可以选择以下操作：**\n\n1. **先创建 `NO_SUCH_TEMP` 点位** — 需要切换到点位管理阶段来创建该模拟量点位，然后再回来配置报警。\n2. **改用已有的 `TEMP_REAL` 点位** — 如果 `TEMP_REAL` 就是您需要监控的温度点，我可以立即为您配置 90°C 的高温报警。\n3. **切换到其他阶段** — 如需进行其他配置操作。\n\n请告诉我您希望怎么处理？", "reasoning": "The system only has one point: \"TEMP_REAL\". The user is asking to configure an alarm on \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" which does not exist. I should inform the user that this point doesn't exist and therefore cannot create an alarm for it. The alarm requires an existing point to monitor."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2944, "output_tokens": 379, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9469.926199992187}, "judge": null}
