56:6e1059cfd20dcf8e36c0f8aed83e1441104cd8e18cd4668cdb6edaa746478909", "final_hash": "sha256:aa0113880cab1ddecd69af71bb038fe0016aa6edea3cbbcae329ad8cf087498b", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 976, "output_tokens": 217, "latency_ms": 6997.210200002883, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你完成这个任务。首先需要查询现有的页面和点位信息，确认 chem_panel 页面和相关点位是否存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants me to:\n1. Create a tank widget on the \"chem_panel\" page\n2. Bind the following points to the tank:\n   - 液位 (Level) → LT_01\n   - 温度 (Temperature) → TT_01\n   - 压力 (Pressure) → PT_01\n\nTo do this, I first need to:\n1. Check the available pages to find \"chem_panel\" and get its page ID\n2. Check the available points to verify that LT_01, TT_01, PT_01 exist\n\nLet me start by querying both the pages and the points to gather the necessary information."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4166, "output_tokens": 354, "latency_ms": 8499.843399971724, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面 `chem_panel`（化工面板）和三个点位都已存在：\n- **LT_01** - 液位 (analog, m)\n- **TT_01** - 温度 (analog, °C)\n- **PT_01** - 压力 (analog, MPa)\n\n现在我来创建罐体控件并绑定这三个点位：", "reasoning": "Both the page and points exist:\n- Page \"chem_panel\" exists\n- Points LT_01 (analog, m), TT_01 (analog, °C), PT_01 (analog, MPa) all exist\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Create a tank widget on chem_panel\n2. Bind the three points to the tank's properties (level, temperature, pressure)\n\nLet me create the tank widget first. I'll use a reasonable position and size for the tank."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4571, "output_tokens": 270, "latency_ms": 6365.740600042045, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体控件创建成功，现在绑定三个点位：", "reasoning": "The tank widget was created successfully. Now I need to bind the three points to the tank's properties:\n- level → LT_01\n- temperature → TT_01\n- pressure → PT_01\n\nLet me make these three binding calls."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4955, "output_tokens": 249, "latency_ms": 7113.722399983089, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 已在化工面板页面成功创建罐体并完成点位绑定。\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `chem_panel`（化工面板） |\n| **控件** | `tank_01` - 罐体 |\n| **位置** | (200, 100)，尺寸 200×300 |\n| **样式** | 蓝色填充，深蓝边框，标签\"化工储罐\" |\n\n### 点位绑定关系：\n| 属性 | 绑定点位 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| `level` | **LT_01** | 液位 (m) |\n| `temperature` | **TT_01** | 温度 (°C) |\n| `pressure` | **PT_01** | 压力 (MPa) |\n\n罐体现在会实时显示这三个点位的数据。如需调整罐体样式、位置，或添加报警配置，请告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All three bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 14668, "output_tokens": 1090, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 29031.116999976803}, "judge": null}
