y_ms": 10216.468400030863, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "查询确认了以下信息：\n- ✅ **source_page** 和 **target_page** 两个页面都存在\n- ✅ **VALVE_1_OPEN** 点位存在（digital 类型）\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 无法完成此操作\n\n很抱歉，您请求的操作包含以下步骤：\n\n| 操作步骤 | 当前工具支持 |\n|---------|------------|\n| 1. 从 source_page 复制 valve1 控件 | ❌ 不支持（无复制/创建控件工具） |\n| 2. 将控件放置到 target_page 位置 [300,120] | ❌ 不支持（无移动/设置控件位置工具） |\n| 3. 绑定点位 VALVE_1_OPEN | ✅ 仅支持 `bind_point` |\n\n当前阶段可用的 `manage_pages` 工具**仅支持 `bind_point` 操作**（绑定已有控件的属性到点位），**不支持**：\n- 创建 / 复制控件\n- 移动控件位置\n- 跨页面操作\n\n---\n\n### 💡 建议\n\n您需要先在 SCADA 图形编辑器中**手动完成**以下操作：\n1. 在 **target_page** 上放置一个与 valve1 类型相同的控件\n2. 将其位置设置为 `[300, 120]`\n3. 记下新控件的 **widget_id**\n\n完成后告诉我新控件的 `widget_id`，我就可以帮您执行第三步——**绑定 `VALVE_1_OPEN` 点位**到该控件。\n\n例如，如果您创建了一个 widget_id 为 `valve1_copy` 的控件，请告诉我：\n> widget_id 是 valve1_copy，绑定 VALVE_1_OPEN", "reasoning": "Good, I can see:\n- Pages: source_page and target_page both exist\n- Points: VALVE_1_OPEN exists (digital type)\n\nHowever, looking at my available tools under manage_pages, I only have:\n- bind_point: Bind a SCADA point tag to a widget property\n\nI do NOT have any tools to:\n1. Copy/move widgets between pages\n2. Create new widgets\n3. Change widget positions\n\nThe user's request requires operations that are beyond my current tool capabilities. I need to explain this to the user.\n\nAlso, I should check if there's a valve1 widget on source_page. But I don't have a tool to list widgets on a page either.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about what I can and cannot do with the available tools."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4785, "output_tokens": 819, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19903.62009999808}, "judge": null}
