{"trace_id": "d53beb2c-b7d0-46f4-ab94-477816c303e6", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:d8111d03027c6197bc75ec239db03cea6480163b29af0800451b0198bea30e15", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-050", "text": "把那个图元往右挪一点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T13:27:09.012Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T13:27:25.566Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T13:27:09.012Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T13:27:25.566Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["apply_flow_layout", "delete_widget", "group_widgets", "set_widget_style"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["delete_point", "create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["delete_script"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["bind_point", "create_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "bind_point", "args": {"action": "bind_point", "page_id": "test", "widget_id": "test", "property": "value", "tag": "test"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "PAGE_NOT_FOUND", "error_msg": "page test not found", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.209600013680756, "intended_entities": ["pages.test.widgets.test.bindings.value"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.test", "pages.test.widgets.test", "points.test"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2930, "output_tokens": 290, "latency_ms": 9129.343600012362, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户说\"把那个图元往右挪一点\"，这是一个关于移动图形元素的请求。但用户没有提供具体信息：哪个页面（page_id）、哪个图元（widget_id）、需要移动到什么位置。\n\n我需要先了解当前项目中有哪些页面和图元，但当前可用的工具中没有直接列出页面或图元的查询工具。根据行为准则，如果信息不足，我应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。\n\n当前可用的工具有：manage_graphics（支持apply_flow_layout, delete_widget, group_widgets, set_widget_style）、manage_points、manage_scripts、manage_pages（支持bind_point, create_widget）、manage_alarms。\n\n要移动图元，我需要知道page_id和widget_id。我可以使用manage_pages的create_widget？不，那是创建新图元，不是移动现有图元。或者用manage_graphics的apply_flow_layout，但那需要widget_ids数组和page_id。还是需要这些信息。\n\n我应该向用户询问更多信息。让我用中文回复，询问需要移动哪个图元以及在哪个页面上。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3255, "output_tokens": 195, "latency_ms": 7405.760699999519, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要更多信息来移动图元。请告诉我：\n\n1. **页面名称（page_id）**：您要操作的是哪个页面？\n2. **图元名称（widget_id）**：要移动的是哪个图元？\n3. **移动目标**：您希望将它移动到什么位置？（比如向右移动多少像素，或者具体的新坐标）\n\n有了这些信息，我就可以帮您调整图元的位置。", "reasoning": "工具调用失败了，因为页面\"test\"不存在。我需要向用户询问具体信息。\n\n让我重新思考：用户想把一个图元向右移动。我需要知道：\n1. 在哪个页面上（page_id）\n2. 哪个图元（widget_id）\n3. 移动到什么位置（新坐标）\n\n或者我可以使用apply_flow_layout来重新布局图元，但需要同样的信息。\n\n我应该直接询问用户这些信息。用中文回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6185, "output_tokens": 485, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16554.416799976025}, "judge": null}
